title: Assign root PackageId for single-package fast path
status: complete
atomic: true
priority: medium
blocked_by: []
created_at: '2026-06-15T05:51:53'
updated_at: '2026-06-15T12:07:18'
result: 'Added root_pkg_id: Option<PkgId> field to Typer + set_root_pkg_id() method.
  In pipeline.rs: after source merge, collect all source bytes, call compute_semantic_hash,
  intern a PackageRecord at root scope with version 0.0.0, pass the resulting PkgId
  into the Typer. Single-package builds now get a deterministic root identity. Zero
  warnings, all 285 lib tests pass, hello.jn compiles and runs.'
description: Implement the single-package fast path that assigns a root PackageId
  without full workspace machinery. Done when a single-package build resolves with
  a root PackageId end-to-end and existing single-package tests pass. Depends on PackageId
  data structure and semantic_hash subtasks.
